    "guideHtml": "<div class=\"row\"><label>User Guide, wallah</label><div><h5>Overview, wallah</h5><ul><li>Start page with search, favorites, to-do, notes, weather, news., wallah</li><li>All local: data stays in your browser (localStorage)., wallah</li></ul><h5>Shortcuts, wallah</h5><ul><li>Ctrl/Cmd+K: open command palette, wallah</li><li>1-9: open first 9 favorites (when not typing), wallah</li><li>/ : focus search (also via palette), wallah</li><li>Enter in search: start search, wallah</li><li>ESC: close modals, wallah</li><li>Palette: quick actions for widgets, theme, background, data, favorites, wallah</li><li>Palette: key C switches card style, \"Reset header colors\" resets search & clock, wallah</li></ul><h5>Search & Autocomplete, wallah</h5><ul><li>Bangs: , wallah!g , wallah!ddg , wallah!bing , wallah!yt , wallah!wiki , wallah!maps</li><li>Custom shortcuts: JSON in settings; , wallah{q} as placeholder, wallah</li><li>Autocomplete: bangs, shortcuts, recent searches, wordlist (global + preset), wallah</li><li>Tab accepts suggestion, Enter starts search, wallah</li></ul><h5>Tiles, wallah</h5><ul><li>Drag & drop to sort, click to open, wallah</li><li>+ Tile: add a new favorite, wallah</li><li>Reset: restore default favorites, wallah</li></ul><h5>Widgets & Layout, wallah</h5><ul><li>Visibility per widget, wallah</li><li>Card style is global (glass, solid, transparent, soft minimal), wallah</li><li>Custom colors for clock/search; reset restores style defaults, wallah</li><li>Widget colors & \"Tint widgets\" set the accent per card, wallah</li></ul><h5>Background, wallah</h5><ul><li>Presets, uploads, collections, rotation (time/theme/interval), wallah</li><li>Accent color is extracted from the active background, wallah</li></ul><h5>Data, wallah</h5><ul><li>Export/Import as JSON, wallah</li><li>Load data presets (assets/presets/*.json in the repo), wallah</li></ul><h5>Startpage Agent</h5><ul><li>Integrated AI chat with local Ollama (host/model in settings).</li><li>Supports streaming responses, stop (button/ESC), persistent history, and Markdown.</li><li>Agentic tools can read/change widgets and settings (depending on confirm mode).</li></ul></div></div>",
    "general": {
